flowchart TD
  A[requestAnimationFrame callback] --> B[Read player and obstacle rectangles]
  B --> C[Inset hitboxes to reduce transparent padding]
  C --> D{Hitboxes overlap?}
  D -->|Yes| E[End session once]
  E --> F[Cancel loop, pause obstacle, show final score]
  D -->|No| G{Obstacle cleared player?}
  G -->|Yes, not scored this pass| H[Increment score once]
  H --> I[Reduce animation duration to bounded minimum]
  G -->|No| J{Obstacle restarted at right edge?}
  I --> J
  J --> K[Schedule next animation frame]
  K --> A
